    "detailed_description": "<strong>A Roguelike Deckbuilder where you fight your biggest nightmares.</strong><br>Find the way trough the doors of your mind and beat the nightmares for good.<br><br>Select cards, build your deck and level up your cards to be strong enough to beat your biggest fears.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622630/extras/feed6aa129909ddacd89e0dcce2f312b.avif?t=1727050957\" width=656 height=216 /></span><br><br>Plan your moves strategically and use the weakness of your enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622630/extras/00c822b57601e3b564bee84fe770d627.avif?t=1727050957\" width=314 height=210 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Roughlite:</strong> Find your way through a random generated world. Choose the right door to find a shop, camp, reward or your next enemys. Use your coins to buy upgrade for your next run, to come back stronger.<br></li><li> <strong>Combin deckbuilding with autobattler:</strong> Collect up to 6 cards, place them strategically against up to 4 enemys and let them fight.<br></li><li> Level and upgrade your cards by using them and combine them with the effect of up to 3 items, that you can win or find in the world.</li></ul>",
